# Season Rules

This season will feature monthly vintage events culminating in a 12 player invitational.  To qualify you must:
A: Place 1st at a monthly event
or
B: Be at the top of the wildcard standings

Wildcard standings will be the players with the most match wins on the season who did not otherwise qualify.  

1st place points: Each invitational competitor will begin the invitational with a number of points equal to their number of victories on the season.  (i.e. if you won two events you'll begin the event up 2 match points)


# Decklists

Decklists are required. Please email your decklist *as plain text* to lonestarlhurgoyfs@gmail.com the day of the tournament.
